# State Directory

This directory stores persistent state when using file-based storage.

## Structure

```
state/
├── tasks/          # Individual task state files
├── workflows/      # Workflow state files
└── .gitkeep        # Keep directory in git
```

## Storage Modes

- **memory** (default) - State exists only in memory, lost on restart
- **file** - State persists to JSON files in this directory
- **sqlite** - State persists to SQLite database

Configure storage mode in `squadron-config.json`:

```json
{
  "stateStorage": "file"
}
```

## Gitignore

All state files are gitignored by default to prevent committing runtime data.
Only this `.gitkeep` file is tracked in git.content">
